# Every text the Figure engine family shipped at a managed path, oldest first: "<sha256>  <path>",
# the digest taken over the text with LF line endings. The last line of a path is its current
# text; every earlier line must be in the family's Prior. TestShippedTextLedger
# (internal/managedasset/shipped_texts_test.go) enforces both directions. After a managed text
# changes, for example when bundle.mjs rebuilds the player after a React or interfig bump:
#   PRAETOR_UPDATE_SHIPPED_TEXTS=1 go test ./internal/managedasset -run 'TestShippedTextLedger$'
# appends the new digest; then record the outgoing text in the family's Prior. Never rewrite or
# drop a line.

